---
import LandingLayout from '../../layouts/LandingLayout.astro';
---

<LandingLayout title="X470 - RamBros 3D" description="X470: The world's first fully 3D printed hydraulic excavator. 1/16 scale, 3D printed pump, valves, and pistons. Part of the TWYN range of heavy vehicle scale models.">

<section class="py-24 px-4">
	<div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
		<img src="/images/image-3.png" alt="X470 Hydraulic Excavator" class="w-40 md:w-48 mx-auto mb-8 drop-shadow-lg" />
		<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-4" style="font-family: 'Belanosima', sans-serif;">X470</h1>
		<p class="text-xl text-base-content/60 mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">The world's first fully 3D printed hydraulic excavator.</p>
		<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 text-sm text-base-content/50">
			<span class="badge badge-outline">1/16 Scale</span>
			<span class="badge badge-outline">3D Printed Hydraulics</span>
			<span class="badge badge-outline">TWYN Range</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 px-4">
	<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
		<div class="text-center mb-16">
			<p class="text-primary font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm mb-3">What Is It</p>
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">A World First in 3D Printing</h2>
			<p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
				The X470 is a <strong>1/16 scale RC hydraulic excavator</strong> featuring a completely 3D printed hydraulic system - including the pump, valves, and pistons. It is the first model of its kind ever made. Part of the <strong>TWYN range</strong> of fully 3D printed heavy vehicle scale models.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-16">
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5 text-center">
				<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-1" style="font-family: 'Belanosima', sans-serif;">1/16</div>
				<div class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Scale</div>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5 text-center">
				<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-1" style="font-family: 'Belanosima', sans-serif;">3.8 kg</div>
				<div class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Weight</div>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5 text-center">
				<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-1" style="font-family: 'Belanosima', sans-serif;">10 bar</div>
				<div class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Working Pressure</div>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5 text-center">
				<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-1" style="font-family: 'Belanosima', sans-serif;">1.5 kg</div>
				<div class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Max Lift</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 mb-16">
			<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
				Fully 3D Printed Hydraulics
			</h3>
			<p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
				The X470's hydraulic system is entirely 3D printed - the <strong>pump, valves, and pistons</strong> are all produced on a standard FDM printer. The system operates with Johnson baby oil (a synthetic mineral oil) and delivers serious performance: each piston generates up to <strong>12 kg of force</strong> at a working pressure of <strong>10 bar</strong>.
			</p>
			<p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
				With the arm fully extended, the X470 can <strong>lift up to 1.5 kg</strong> - all from a hydraulic system made entirely of PLA.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 px-4">
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
		<div class="text-center mb-16">
			<p class="text-primary font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm mb-3">Features</p>
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Built for the Advanced Maker</h2>
			<p class="text-base-content/60 max-w-xl mx-auto">The X470 is a complex, rewarding project that pushes the boundaries of what FDM 3D printing can do.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
					<h3 class="font-bold">3D Printed Hydraulics</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm">Complete hydraulic system - pump, valves, and pistons - all printed on an FDM printer. A world first.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
					<h3 class="font-bold">BLDC Motors</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm">High-quality BLDC motors for the pump, swing, and tracks. Travel motors powered via a 4-pin audio jack.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="2.18" ry="2.18"/><line x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="22"/><line x1="17" y1="2" x2="17" y2="22"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/></svg>
					<h3 class="font-bold">Battery Counterweight</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm">The 4S LiFePo4 battery doubles as the counterweight - functional and weight-accurate.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
					<h3 class="font-bold">Strength Through Design</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm">Structural rigidity achieved through good design alone - no metal plates or bars for reinforcement.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
					<h3 class="font-bold">Realistic Cabin</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm">Detailed cockpit with functional cabin and work lights for an authentic look.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><path d="M5.636 18.364a9 9 0 0 1 0-12.728m12.728 0a9 9 0 0 1 0 12.728m-9.9-2.829a5 5 0 0 1 0-7.07m7.072 0a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07M13 12a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0z"/></svg>
					<h3 class="font-bold">No Painting Required</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm">Printed in Esun PLA across 5 recommended colors - Orange, Dark Grey, Light Grey, Transparent, White, and Black.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 px-4">
	<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
		<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10">
			<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
				Materials &amp; Build Details
			</h3>
			<p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
				Pistons are made with <strong>aluminum pipes</strong> and 3D printed end-caps. <strong>PU tubes</strong> are used for hydraulic tubing. The model is printed using <strong>Esun PLA</strong> in 5 recommended colors. Glass bed-printed mating surfaces provide improved hydraulic integrity.
			</p>
			<p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
				While the 3.8 kg weight is lighter than a metal equivalent (a real 47-ton excavator at 1/16 scale would weigh ~11.47 kg), the X470 is remarkably strong for a model made entirely of PLA.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 px-4">
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
		<div class="text-center mb-12">
			<p class="text-primary font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm mb-3">Watch It Work</p>
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Build Video</h2>
		</div>
		<div class="aspect-video w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
			<iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dcK82xBHUmk" title="X470 Hydraulic Excavator" frameborder="0" class="w-full h-full" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 px-4">
	<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
		<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Get the Files</h2>
		<p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
			The X470 is an advanced build - not for the faint of heart. It requires significant time, patience, and expertise to build. The 3D printed hydraulics are a world's first and have never been done before, making this model more complex than typical 3D printed projects.
		</p>
		<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
			<a href="https://cults3d.com/en/3d-model/game/x470-the-world-s-first-fully-3d-printed-hydraulic-excavator" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get X470 on Cults3D</a>
			<a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/rambros/e/310366" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Buy Me a Coffee</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

</LandingLayout>
